Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.01,0:00:14.82,Main Dialogue Top,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go over the mission one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.12,Main Dialogue Top,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,At 1300 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.42,0:00:20.12,Main Dialogue Top,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,each squad will take helicopters to their\Ndesignated mountain-entry points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:23.81,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,They will then spend a night \Nwiping out any Savages they encounter
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:26.88,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,and return to base \Nat 1700 hours tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.19,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's all well and good...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.19,0:00:31.49,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But what's with these team assignments?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.49,0:00:35.09,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,It's an honor to be in\Nthe same team as you, Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.42,0:00:39.08,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,We must be connected by fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.44,0:00:39.90,Flashback Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,No, we're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:41.86,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Also, I'm Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.86,0:00:43.14,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:47.35,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I played along with you yesterday,\Nbut we're going into battle for real today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.35,0:00:51.32,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,During this mission, I'm going to\Nprove to you how superior I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:54.70,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,"Played along"? You're the one who started it...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.70,0:00:55.82,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Claudia Loetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.45,0:00:58.03,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:03.21,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I understand that you would like to take \NEmile Crossfode back to your country,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:08.42,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,but he is a valuable asset to the {\i1}Little Garden,{\i0}\Nand an important crewmate of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.44,0:01:10.65,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,President...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:13.75,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If he insists on staying \Nat the {\i1}Little Garden,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.75,0:01:16.53,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,then we will do everything we can\Nto keep him there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.01,0:01:18.43,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you say that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.36,0:01:21.97,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're going into battle together,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.31,0:01:25.56,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,so I wanted to let you know what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.40,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I trust we're on the same page?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.87,0:01:32.44,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I understand!\NI'm not that irresponsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.33,0:01:34.82,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.21,0:01:38.33,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,President, we've come \Nto see you before we sortie.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:39.53,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.53,0:01:41.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You're in Squad F, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.67,0:01:45.74,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Us and two women, Ally and Wendy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:48.00,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Basically, as long as we don't\N run into any Savages,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:50.58,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,I get to enjoy my own\Npersonal harem to the fullest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.58,0:01:51.25,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:54.49,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, "harem"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.49,0:01:56.64,Main Dialogue Top,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,I was just kidding! It was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:01:58.01,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.83,0:02:00.85,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,The helicopters are ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.85,0:02:03.01,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, please head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.06,0:02:08.89,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liu Xuemei, although you'll \Nbe staying behind here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:11.65,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,you're a {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.10,0:02:13.95,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're counting on your backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.70,0:02:16.03,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,R-Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:22.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.63,0:04:02.26,Episode Title,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Night at the {\c&H0303C1&}Lake
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.87,0:04:06.65,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You're finished!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.00,0:04:14.89,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,We can't let her hog the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:15.41,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:18.89,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,We got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.89,0:04:20.48,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.48,0:04:23.76,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Stand there and watch me, Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.06,0:04:25.95,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.14,0:04:41.13,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So that's her Hundred, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.13,0:04:45.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Claudia wants to show off, \Nso how about we watch her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.80,0:04:49.53,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.53,0:04:51.27,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Tudor Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.33,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, finish it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.33,0:05:01.11,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Why me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:03.25,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Hurry up! This is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:04.97,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,G-Got it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:06.81,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:19.88,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.16,0:05:22.16,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's my Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.16,0:05:23.51,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I told you, I'm Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.82,0:05:28.46,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think I'm more useful \Nthan Kisaragi Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.46,0:05:31.39,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,We worked together seamlessly just now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.82,0:05:35.39,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Is that why you had me \Nland the finishing blow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.39,0:05:37.14,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.14,0:05:39.98,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,It's the first time we've worked together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:41.40,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.69,0:05:44.28,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Birds of a feather...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.15,0:05:50.53,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,I can't find any other Savages\Nin the area except for these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.98,0:05:53.73,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We've just started.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.73,0:05:58.42,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to take out as many Savages as possible\Nuntil we leave the mountain tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.62,Main Dialogue,All,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:02.67,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,Look at them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:06.55,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many Slayers \Nand Savages in one spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.85,0:06:09.68,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,A mountain of treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:13.89,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.44,0:06:15.77,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Rocket Knuckles!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.35,0:06:25.21,Main Dialogue,Ally,0000,0000,0000,,You're good, Reitia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.51,0:06:27.07,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:29.42,Main Dialogue,Wendy,0000,0000,0000,,That makes two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:33.02,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,But the two of them are\N using up too much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.02,0:06:35.09,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,They need to make it last.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:35.83,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.33,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,We've got a long road ahead of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.47,0:06:43.03,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Everything's going smoothly, Claire-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:43.46,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.14,0:06:47.21,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're doing better than expected, \Nhaving taken out five already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.49,0:06:51.86,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato hasn't landed \Nthe finishing blow on any yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:55.60,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Emilia-sama. Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.50,0:07:03.93,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,That's because you're taking \Nall the good stuff for yourself, Claudia.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.23,0:07:05.50,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.50,0:07:06.73,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.25,0:07:10.53,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind just doing damage \Nor acting as a decoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.78,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,How gallant of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.78,0:07:15.24,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Trying to act cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.23,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.23,0:07:20.66,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,it sounds as if there are \Ngoing to be showers tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.25,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:25.63,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I doubt light rain will pose\N much of a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.26,0:07:30.23,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,but we'll have to be careful with \Nbeam weapons, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.17,0:07:36.87,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to split into two groups\Nand take turns getting four hours of sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.87,0:07:40.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The group that's awake will secure\Nthe perimeter and keep watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:41.39,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.80,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be with Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.80,0:07:44.90,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.90,0:07:46.71,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone, go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:48.37,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Emile Crossfode,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.37,0:07:50.74,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,it's dangerous for you two \Nbe alone together!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.74,0:07:52.10,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:53.19,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.19,0:07:54.84,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:57.81,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato's the only guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:08:00.62,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,He can't be alone with anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.62,0:08:02.41,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a guy, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.66,0:08:06.31,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,So Emilia-sama and I will team up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.31,0:08:07.98,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:11.34,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, be gentle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.63,0:08:14.96,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It makes sense for the two guys \Nto group together, Hayato and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:17.87,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really think you'll be able \Nto use that excuse here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.87,0:08:19.06,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:24.31,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Why am I with the vice president \Ninstead of Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.77,0:08:26.19,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,What's done is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:31.15,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, let's get the fire going before\Nit starts to rain and our kindling gets wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.15,0:08:32.34,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Blah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.62,0:08:39.62,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.24,0:08:48.50,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:49.34,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.88,0:08:52.29,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Getting sleep is also part of your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.58,0:08:55.47,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You can't call yourself a good Slayer\Nwithout being able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:56.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:02.73,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Everything is quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.13,0:09:06.48,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,There was a shower earlier, \Nbut it ended quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.02,0:09:10.92,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,According to HQ, \Nwe've taken out 42 Savages in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.39,0:09:14.74,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,There are more Savages here than estimated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:17.86,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We need to be even more on guard, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:20.74,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,We'll rest now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.08,0:09:22.89,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go, Emile Crossfode.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.89,0:09:23.87,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.80,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato, let's talk a lot later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.80,0:09:28.05,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.05,0:09:29.88,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Good night, Emilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:31.34,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It's Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.22,0:09:36.39,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The stars are nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.05,0:09:38.76,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. Karen—
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.09,0:09:42.39,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,My sister would have loved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:45.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You sure care about your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.78,0:09:47.69,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's just us two siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:51.71,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,She's sick and can't travel all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.57,0:09:54.40,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Siblings, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.42,0:09:56.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I didn't mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.70,0:09:59.07,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:04.55,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I hope we can make it a world
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:08.93,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,where everyone can relax and look up \Nat the sky, like we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.69,0:10:13.28,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That's why we're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:16.12,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:19.72,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry to bug you two\N while you're getting cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.04,0:10:22.83,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is it, Claudia Loetty?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.83,0:10:26.35,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, but with you two \Nlooking up at the stars like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:29.71,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,it reminds me of a\N romantic scene out of a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.02,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's not what...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.56,0:10:35.15,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I think I saw
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.15,0:10:38.00,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,a pretty large shadow \Nmoving over towards the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.00,0:10:39.46,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Was it just my imagination?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.91,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A large shadow?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.91,0:10:44.41,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I was thinking there could be \Na Savage over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.41,0:10:47.91,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,How about you two check it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.35,0:10:49.58,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We should?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.90,0:10:52.08,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.08,0:10:53.73,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,If there's an emergency,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.73,0:10:56.34,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I'll wake up Emilia-sama and Erica \Nand take care of things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.69,0:11:00.09,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:03.84,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,If there's nothing there, \Nsince you're already by the lake,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.84,0:11:06.53,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,why not go on a date \Nwhile you're at it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.53,0:11:08.19,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I won't bug you,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.19,0:11:11.02,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,so feel free to get as cozy as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.28,0:11:13.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,D-Don't be ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.54,0:11:15.67,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,L-Let's go, Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:18.49,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't a date.\NWe're only patrolling the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.84,0:11:20.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.20,0:11:22.24,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Be careful, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:26.15,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it went well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.15,0:11:29.94,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,It seems the queen is interested \Nin Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:32.91,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,If the two of them get lovey-dovey,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.91,0:11:36.91,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I can get Emilia-sama back to Gudenburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.52,0:12:01.65,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Just as Claudia said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:02.52,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.05,0:12:06.68,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This is Claire. Come in, Claudia Loetty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.44,0:12:09.63,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,A transmission error?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.50,0:12:12.90,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be bad if we went back and lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.20,0:12:14.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If there's just one of them...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:16.96,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,We can take care of it right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:27.76,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Prez!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.49,0:12:40.86,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.60,0:12:51.02,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That was surprising. \NYou just tripped out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:55.61,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I... I could have taken care of it \Nwithout your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:12:58.85,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,But thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:13:00.33,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.96,0:13:05.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Your suit is all dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.26,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:09.18,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I can't go back like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.45,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to wash off first.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.51,0:13:26.94,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.94,0:13:29.75,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I want to talk to Hayato just a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.99,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.99,0:13:33.39,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.39,0:13:35.46,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Where are the president and Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.89,0:13:39.14,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, I hate to be the one to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:42.46,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,but the two of them \Nwent on a date to the lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.90,0:13:44.76,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,A-A date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.15,0:13:57.61,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,H-How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.61,0:13:59.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.75,0:14:02.65,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,No, the geothermal properties \Nhave turned it into a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.15,0:14:05.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I can clean myself well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.69,0:14:07.24,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.27,0:14:13.41,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,So the president and Hayato\N went to the lake together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.02,0:14:15.79,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I don't really believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:17.48,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.48,0:14:21.08,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia-sama, you don't need \Nto be with that cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.08,0:14:23.17,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Come back to Gudenburg with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.17,0:14:23.81,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.81,0:14:25.84,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:29.49,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Even if the president \Nand Hayato get together,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:30.93,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.93,0:14:35.43,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to run back to my country\Njust because someone else took Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.81,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:42.19,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Have you been able to gain more control\Nover your Variant power now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.19,0:14:45.16,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I haven't had any problems while training,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.46,0:14:52.06,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but it hasn't activated in actual combat since\Nthe battle on Zwei Islands, so it's hard to tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:57.16,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,How does it feel when \Nyour Variant power activates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:14:59.64,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really explain it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.64,0:15:03.37,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but it feels like all your senses \Nare distant from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:06.30,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Time flows slowly....
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:12.03,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,So she must've experienced that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.55,0:15:13.42,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,She?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.47,0:15:17.31,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,My sister, Liza.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:22.61,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,But she's different from you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:24.62,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,She's a designer baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.72,0:15:29.32,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Savage fluids were injected \Ninto a fertilized egg,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.86,0:15:32.03,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,and she was born a Variant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.46,0:15:35.26,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Did Vitaly do that, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:38.90,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,No. That woman was no more than an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.66,0:15:42.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The person in charge of\N the project was Linis Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.23,0:15:45.25,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Our mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:47.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:50.52,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Why would you do that to your own child?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.79,0:15:53.47,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,My mother said that
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.15,0:15:56.97,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,it was to beat the gods in war.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:00.64,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Beat the gods in war?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.42,0:16:03.62,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,As my mother wished,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.92,0:16:10.23,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liza exhibited extremely rare—abnormal, even—\Ntalent as a Slayer from a young age.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:17.91,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,But one day, she released a forbidden power \Nin order to save me from a Savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.21,0:16:25.88,Flashback Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.86,0:16:33.56,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Ever since then, \NLiza's been sleeping like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.35,0:16:37.16,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I say "sleeping,"\N but her body is, even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.16,0:16:43.82,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,releasing enough energy \Nto power the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:47.34,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, Liza is Warslarn's...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.93,0:16:50.04,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,My brother Judar's trump card.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.24,0:16:54.16,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The reason why I'm the \N{\i1}Little Garden{\i0}'s captain
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.53,0:16:57.29,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,is so I can keep an eye on Judar's actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:17:00.69,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liza isn't a tool for their ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:04.67,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,She's my precious little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.11,0:17:07.96,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,How selfish, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.39,0:17:10.51,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I act like I'm working \Ntowards some just cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:16.14,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,but it's really all about my family:\Nmy sister, brother, and mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:17.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.94,0:17:20.16,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,I might be in a position of responsibility,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.16,0:17:22.70,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,but I really just want to \Nprotect my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.62,0:17:24.92,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.68,0:17:29.29,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think that makes me \Na failure of a captain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.09,0:17:33.03,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,No. I'm the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:36.40,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,If my sister hadn't needed treatment,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:38.68,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I might not have become a Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.66,0:17:42.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I think most people fight for similar reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.11,0:17:45.56,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,World peace and justice \Nare great reasons, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.19,0:17:49.18,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but your own personal reasons \Nand situation are also important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:52.17,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,So I don't think \Nwhat you're doing is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.09,0:17:56.48,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.44,0:17:59.63,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I figured this out after becoming a Slayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:03.93,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This power can put smiles on people's faces.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.62,0:18:07.91,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,If I can defend someone's smile by fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.32,0:18:11.32,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,that's enough reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.94,0:18:18.07,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,If I can make this world a better place where\Neveryone's happy and nobody gets hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.86,0:18:20.93,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If that's what you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.93,0:18:23.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure your Hundred will give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:25.97,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:32.59,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,would you continue to use your ideals\N and your power for the {\i1}Little Garden?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:35.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do everything I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:37.85,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.85,0:18:39.58,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's an emergency call.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.69,0:18:56.10,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato, \Nyou saw my boobs, didn't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.10,0:18:58.60,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,And you grabbed them tight...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.60,0:18:59.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.91,0:19:01.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.71,0:19:07.01,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I-I'll make sure you\Ntake responsibility for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.87,0:19:09.66,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This is Kisaragi Hayato from Squad E.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.66,0:19:12.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I just got your emergency call.\NWhat's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.69,0:19:16.30,Italics Dialogue,Zayed,0000,0000,0000,,This is Zayed Huffman from Squad D.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.67,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on, Zayed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:22.12,Italics Dialogue,Zayed,0000,0000,0000,,We were just attacked by a three Hunters.\NSquad D has been wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.12,0:19:25.22,Italics Dialogue,Zayed,0000,0000,0000,,They're attacking all the squads.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.22,0:19:27.32,Italics Dialogue,Zayed,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone should be on alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:30.24,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,A-Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:31.86,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Three Hunters...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.24,0:19:35.89,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It has to be the same ones that \Nappeared on Zwei Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:39.18,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Which means they must be \Njamming the communications.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:40.98,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm worried about Emile and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.98,0:19:42.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.91,0:19:45.20,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,That's Fritz.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.70,0:19:47.83,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's a signal flare to alert us of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:53.43,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato, get back to the tent and\Ntell Erica and the rest what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.43,0:19:55.51,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:57.46,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But if you're alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:19:59.58,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,No need to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:02.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0}'s \Nstudent council president.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.48,0:20:05.40,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If my fellow students require help,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.40,0:20:07.26,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,it is my duty to rush right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.61,0:20:09.64,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.72,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,That's too bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:14.77,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,Reinforcements will be \Ncoming any moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.05,0:20:17.20,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:22.53,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.79,0:20:27.28,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,As you heard, I can't go down\N until reinforcements come.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:29.30,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Like you can hold us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.60,0:20:31.29,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,I'll finish you off in a flash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.29,0:20:33.66,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Limit out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:35.21,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Variant mode?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.29,0:20:39.77,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Is that all you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.07,0:20:41.76,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Quit running your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:48.76,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.76,0:20:51.23,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,I'm taking your Hundred, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.01,0:20:55.90,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Who is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.85,0:21:00.83,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you hurt my comrades?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.21,0:21:02.78,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,The perfect queen!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:04.91,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,And she's in her full-body armament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.40,0:21:07.82,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,So you know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:08.95,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.66,0:21:11.04,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.01,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I was late, Liddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:16.04,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You've done well to stand against them \Nas long as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.84,0:21:18.06,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.66,0:21:19.84,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.08,0:21:24.05,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I have a question for you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.70,0:21:28.54,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Tell me what you know about Vitaly Tynyanov.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:30.64,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Why do you know about Vitaly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:34.41,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,If you surrender now and provide \Ninformation about everything you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.41,0:21:36.77,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I can guarantee your safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.77,0:21:39.65,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,But even if you don't, \Nyou're going to tell me what you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.90,0:21:40.92,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.08,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,You Warslarn lapdog!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.81,0:21:48.74,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Resistance is futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.21,0:21:52.76,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you use your Variant power,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.76,0:21:55.50,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,it's not as strong as \Nmy full-body armament.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.91,0:21:57.81,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Reinforcements will be coming soon, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.81,0:22:01.50,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Give up, leave the Hundreds \Nyou've taken, and surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.44,0:22:09.11,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Rain?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.88,0:22:11.93,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Nee-chan. Nakri.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.44,0:22:16.00,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,It seems luck is on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.87,0:24:05.79,Next Episode Title,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1000,1)}{\c&H0303C1&}Dragon {\c&HFFFFFF&}Type
